  "rationale": "Carry of D1 on the fifth front forward, boundary law neutral; not a new candidate. Its tip-law numbers are those of D1 of bass_front.wsp (sha256:ac15e49f1cb60d4b4679bcdff82a07c18a4a501454428e35ac86e935e168855c), typed by the author (claude-fable-5-2), copied statement by statement by tools/wsp/front5_edits.py without change; D1's quench hazard (quench.*) is not part of bass_front-wsp-v5 and is dropped. The boundary-law tensors hold the neutral setting of the root (chosen from the bounds by the engineer who wired the forward, claude-opus-5-5; no physical claim): the sample always ignites and a flame never goes out. Its tip forecasts are those of D1 case by case; it stands in for D1 in paired comparisons with candidates of bass_front-wsp-v5. Exposure: that of D1.",
